    {
      "sectionTitle": "Configure logs ingestion",
      "sectionText": "The default configuration provides demo logs. It lets you explore the features of the solution. \n**To access your cloud instance logs**, select \"Cloud logs\" and select **dku-audit-log** connection as explained [here](https://doc.dataiku.com/dss/latest/operations/audit-trail/dataikucloud.html#access-instances-audit-logs).\n**To access event server logs**, select \"Event Server logs\" and configure the connection to point to the output of your Event Server logs.",
